    "sourceUrl": "https://www.h3c.com/en/Support/Resource_Center/EN/Switches/Catalog/S5130S/S5130S-EI/Technical_Documents/Product_Literature/Hardware_Information___Specifications/H3C_S5130S-EI_IG/202306/1867335_294551_0.htm",
    "note": "370 W total PoE power on AC and 740 W on a DC feed, 30 W maximum a port. 370 W runs 24 ports at 15.4 W (802.3af) or 12 at 30 W (802.3at) per the vendor PoE table - not 48 x 30 W."
  },
  "fabric": {
    "capacityMbps": 104000,
    "kind": "switching fabric",
    "note": "Port switching capacity 104 Gbps (48 x 1G copper + 4 x 1G SFP, full duplex), forwarding capacity 78 Mpps."
  },
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.h3c.com/en/Products_and_Solutions/InterConnect/Switches/Products/Campus_Network/Access/S5130/H3C_S5130S_EI/",
  "notes": "S5130S-EI common platform (Comware 7): box switching capacity 336 Gbps, 256 MB flash / 512 MB SDRAM, IRF2 stacking of up to 9 units, static routes plus RIP and OSPF, 802.1Q VLAN, LACP, STP/RSTP/MSTP, DHCP server, SNMPv1/v2c/v3, NETCONF/gRPC, web UI and CLI. Port layout and PoE totals from the vendor hardware-information page (https://www.h3c.com/en/Support/Resource_Center/EN/Switches/Catalog/S5130S/S5130S-EI/Technical_Documents/Product_Literature/Hardware_Information___Specifications/H3C_S5130S-EI_IG/202306/1867335_294551_0.htm); switching and forwarding figures from the vendor product page (https://www.h3c.com/en/Products_and_Solutions/InterConnect/Switches/Products/Campus_Network/Access/S5130/H3C_S5130S_EI/). Current software line is Comware 7 CMW710, release R6381 listed on the H3C resource centre for this series (https://www.h3c.com/en/Support/Resource_Center/EN/Switches/Catalog/S5130S/S5130S-EI/default.htm). One fan, 440 x 400 x 43.6 mm, <= 6 kg, 36 W minimum / 467 W maximum draw (PoE 370 W), 16 Gbps maximum stacking bandwidth, serial console only. The -AC suffix denotes the fixed AC supply; the four cages stay 1G SFP."
}
